IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. EVAL.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 CODE-VAL   PIC 99 VALUE 3.
01 NAME-VAL   PIC X(8) VALUE "BOB".
01 SW         PIC X VALUE "A".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    EVALUATE CODE-VAL
        WHEN 1 DISPLAY "one"
        WHEN 2 THRU 5 DISPLAY "two to five"
        WHEN 6 WHEN 7 DISPLAY "six or seven"
        WHEN OTHER DISPLAY "other"
    END-EVALUATE
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN CODE-VAL > 10 DISPLAY "big"
        WHEN CODE-VAL < 0 DISPLAY "negative"
        WHEN OTHER CONTINUE
    END-EVALUATE
    EVALUATE NAME-VAL ALSO SW
        WHEN "BOB" ALSO "A" DISPLAY "bob a"
        WHEN ANY ALSO "B" DISPLAY "any b"
        WHEN OTHER DISPLAY "none"
    END-EVALUATE
    STOP RUN.
